    "title_en": "Study of the Strangeness Production in Xe + CsI Interactions with the BM@N Spectrometer",
    "abstract_en": "Study of the production of strange particles in nuclear interactions is one of the most important items of the BM@N experimental program at the Nuclotron-NICA accelerator complex, as strange probes carry information about the properties of the created nuclear medium. This paper presents preliminary results from a study of the production of Λ hyperons and $K_{S}^{0}$ mesons in Xe + CsI interactions at an energy $\\sqrt {{{s}_{{NN}}}} = 3.26$ GeV.",
